  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">M4D 3.0 - Mobile for Development (M4D): Strategic Partnership for Inclusion, Innovation and Scale</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The purpose of the Mobile for Development programme (M4D) is to bring together the mobile ecosystem and the development sector to stimulate digital innovation to deliver sustainable business models and large-scale socio-economic impact for low-income people in developing countries. The programme is improving climate resilience, livelihoods and access to opportunities for women and underserved groups, as well as mitigating climate change. This is being achieved by unlocking mobile-enabled innovation which deliver on the Global Goals, as well as improving people&#x2019;s access to and use of digital and mobile services.</narrative>
  </description>
